WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.708
Open Account Access and click Install. The app prepares the software and browser
for you.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:18.417
Your existing AI tools are detected automatically. The same portable skill works
through a command-line client. You don't choose an agent during setup.

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:30.125
Connect your configured email mailbox once, using its email address and
application password. This example mailbox uses encrypted IMAP.

00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:39.542
For iPhone, forward texts to Messages and allow the Account Access app in Mac
privacy settings. Android users pair the phone companion instead.

00:00:39.542 --> 00:00:52.250
Choose a password export from Chrome or another supported manager. Review the
matched accounts and approve their reads. Import authenticator keys only if you
choose that option.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:01:02.958
When your accounts are connected, copy the request and open Claude Code. You can
use the same skill from Codex or another compatible local agent.

00:01:02.958 --> 00:01:09.458
Ask Claude to read your connected accounts and save progress as one task.

00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:21.667
Claude discovers the permitted accounts and starts the task. We expired the
example sessions so you can watch each fresh sign-in.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:33.375
Account Access fills the saved username and password and signs in automatically.

00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:46.333
For the authenticator account, it generates the login code from the explicitly
imported setup key and submits it. You don't open the authenticator app.

00:01:46.333 --> 00:02:00.792
For email verification, it reads the fresh matching message from the connected
mailbox and submits the code. You don't copy it.

00:02:00.792 --> 00:02:13.625
For SMS, it retrieves the matching fresh login message and submits the code.
This recording uses a controlled Messages fixture; real phone delivery still
needs validation.

00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:29.333
Claude returns all four results and the saved task ID. From the request through
completion, the user entered no password or verification code. These are
configured example accounts; private websites need reviewed connectors.
